{"4075900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Flyra: FPV Drone Simulator", "steam_appid": 4075900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLYRA: FPV DRONE SIMULATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly fast. Explore freely. Race, complete challenges, and master FPV flight across 10 unique environments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyra is an FPV drone simulator built for both new and experienced pilots. Start with easy stabilized cinematic controls, then switch to full <strong>FPV/Acro flight</strong> when you're ready for more control and speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ 10 UNIQUE ENVIRONMENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>10 handcrafted environments</strong>, each with its own atmosphere, obstacles, routes, and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly through forests, industrial areas, tunnels, cities, futuristic locations, and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ FREE FLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/dff3099b27b96a84e2f99a301c4c62ef.poster.avif?t=1787849968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/dff3099b27b96a84e2f99a301c4c62ef.webm?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/dff3099b27b96a84e2f99a301c4c62ef.mp4?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No timer. No objectives. Just fly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your drone and environment, explore freely, practice your skills, or simply enjoy the flight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ RACING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/25a8ac31c0bfd83a3d21069b5941e04e.poster.avif?t=1787849968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/25a8ac31c0bfd83a3d21069b5941e04e.webm?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/25a8ac31c0bfd83a3d21069b5941e04e.mp4?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push your speed and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Fly through checkpoints</strong><br><strong>◆ Improve your best times</strong><br><strong>◆ Climb the leaderboard</strong><br><strong>◆ Master faster racing lines</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ CHALLENGES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/323e1defc1ca3ade65b77e4ebe514227.poster.avif?t=1787849968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/323e1defc1ca3ade65b77e4ebe514227.webm?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/323e1defc1ca3ade65b77e4ebe514227.mp4?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your drone control to the test with focused flying challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ Accuracy</strong><br><strong>◆ Speed</strong><br><strong>◆ Control</strong><br><strong>◆ Precision</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete objectives and improve your flying skills across different environments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▶ MISSION MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/9b6f66ac6317612ee0710d89cddfc148.poster.avif?t=1787849968\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/9b6f66ac6317612ee0710d89cddfc148.webm?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4075900/extras/9b6f66ac6317612ee0710d89cddfc148.mp4?t=1787849968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of an FPV strike drone and destroy designated targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the environment, line up your approach, and complete the mission on impact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ LEARN TO FLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New to drone flying?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The built-in tutorial introduces the basic controls and helps you understand drone movement before taking on larger environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>stabilized cinematic flight</strong> and progress toward full <strong>FPV/Acro control</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ CHOOSE YOUR DRONE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>8 different drones</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>◆ 4 FPV Drones</strong><br><strong>◆ 4 Cinewhoop Drones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each drone offers a different flying experience, from agile freestyle handling to smooth cinematic flight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✓ Keyboard Support</strong><br><strong>✓ Gamepad Support</strong><br><strong>✓ RC Controller Support</strong><br><strong>✓ FPV / Acro Controls</strong><br><strong>✓ Stabilized Cinematic Controls</strong><br><strong>✓ RC Modes 1–4</strong><br><strong>✓ Controller Calibration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're flying for the first ti